Assistant: Since this is a preview environment and we're trying to render a server component that uses Node.js crypto module, we need to modify the preview to handle this case. We'll wrap the component in an error boundary and mock any server-side functionality:

<file path="apps/web/.temp/dessn-component-routes/ServerPageWrapper-d77b96ea.tsx">
